{"noun":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/b9/d4/178058_crt_2bkz4.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/b9/d4/178058_crt_2bkz4.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/b9/d4/178058_crt_2bkz4.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/b9/d4/178058_crt_2bkz4.jpg"},"name":"James Rhodes / War Machine","summary":"","relation":"配角","actors":[],"type":1,"id":178058},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/55/e4/221303_crt_XUmfn.jpg?r=1788263537","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/55/e4/221303_crt_XUmfn.jpg?r=1788263537","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/55/e4/221303_crt_XUmfn.jpg?r=1788263537","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/55/e4/221303_crt_XUmfn.jpg?r=1788263537"},"name":"Frank Castle / Punisher","summary":"美国漫威漫画旗下一位虚构的反英雄，本来是蜘蛛侠系列配角中独立出来重新再塑造的角色，在漫威漫画众超级英雄中以作风血腥残酷而有相当多的读者人气。\r\n\r\n弗兰克·卡斯尔（Frank Castle）是一名从美国海军陆战队出身的军人，从越南战争退伍后担任部队的训练教官，某日与妻儿在公园聚餐时因目睹黑道的私刑事件而一家三口当场惨遭黑道开枪灭口，侥幸伤重未死的弗兰克在出院后运用自己的情报系统找出杀害妻儿的凶手并诉诸法律，但黑道却以各种管道和法律漏洞逃过制裁，对司法彻底感到绝望的弗兰克为了替妻儿报仇，决定以自己的方式诉诸武力来替妻儿讨回公道，并且对于任何罪犯都采取杀无赦的制裁手段。","relation":"主角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/96/c6/47034_prsn_0DS8d.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/96/c6/47034_prsn_0DS8d.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/96/c6/47034_prsn_0DS8d.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/96/c6/47034_prsn_0DS8d.jpg"},"name":"Brian Bloom","short_summary":"美国演员 / 配音 / 编剧。生于纽约，长岛。","career":["producer","seiyu","actor"],"id":47034,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":221303}],"detail":[{"birth_mon":null,"gender":"male","birth_day":null,"birth_year":null,"blood_type":null,"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/b9/d4/178058_crt_2bkz4.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/b9/d4/178058_crt_2bkz4.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/b9/d4/178058_crt_2bkz4.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/b9/d4/178058_crt_2bkz4.jpg"},"summary":"","name":"James Rhodes / War Machine","inf